      Monson, K. L. (2025). TBI-induced vessel softening increases brain susceptibility to injury
      with repeated head trauma. <em>Journal of the Mechanical Behavior of Biomedical Materials</em>,
      107287.
      <a href="https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jmbbm.2025.107287">doi:10.1016/j.jmbbm.2025.107287</a>
